-- statement:
--   **The rung $r=2$ of Challenge 7.** The sphere-packing constant of $\mathbb R^2$ equals its lattice-packing constant:
--
--   $$\Delta_2=\Delta_2^L .$$
--
--   Both equal $\pi/\sqrt{12}$, attained by the hexagonal lattice.
-- source:
--   L. Fejes Tóth, Über einen geometrischen Satz, Math. Z. 46 (1940), 83–85, https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01181430 (optimality of the hexagonal packing); the lattice case is Lagrange (1773)

